        <h1>Privacy Policy – Thrill Family</h1>
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 2026</p>

        <p>
          Thrill Family is an internal workforce management application designed
          exclusively for authorized company personnel.
        </p>

        <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p>The application may collect the following information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Employee name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Employee ID</li>
          <li>Profile image (if uploaded)</li>
          <li>Attendance records</li>
          <li>Precise location data for attendance verification and geofencing</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>2. How We Use the Information</h3>
        <p>The collected data is used solely for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>User authentication</li>
          <li>Employee management</li>
          <li>Attendance verification</li>
          <li>Geofencing within authorized company locations</li>
          <li>Internal administrative operations</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3. Location Data</h3>
        <p>
          Precise location data is collected only to verify employee attendance
          within designated company areas. Location data is not used for
          advertising, tracking, or marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h3>4. Data Sharing</h3>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or share personal data with third parties.
          All collected information is used strictly for internal company operations.
        </p>

        <h3>5. Data Security</h3>
        <p>
          We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures
          to protect user data from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse.
        </p>

        <h3>6. User Access and Control</h3>
        <p>
          User accounts are created and managed by the organization.
          Employees may contact their company administrator regarding access,
          correction, or deletion of their data.
        </p>

        <h3>7. Contact Information</h3>
        <p>
          For privacy-related inquiries, please contact:<br>
          <strong>Email:</strong> support@yourcompany.com
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
